      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] On ARMv8-M, MPU regions cannot be configured with \"Privileged No-Access\" (`P_NA`) permissions. Therefore, disabling the MPU region here relies entirely on the default memory map being disabled (via `CONFIG_MPU_DISABLE_BACKGROUND_MAP\u003dy` which clears `PRIVDEFENA`) to prevent privileged access. \n\nThis is a critical security property and a non-obvious hardware limitation. Please add a brief comment here explaining this dependency. This hardware limitation also explains why MPU-related unit tests running in privileged mode with the background map enabled will fail to trigger faults.",
